; Echo Tops (kft above the radar) — authored for this project over the
; conventional 0..70 kft NWS-style display range (compute::derived's
; ECHO_TOP_MAX_KFT, ADR-0020). Not sourced from a specific published
; GRLevelX palette — see ADR-0021's verification note. Blue (low tops)
; through green/yellow to red/magenta (overshooting-top-scale heights).
